      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1935007862784143444",
      "text": "[5:08PM] #Jibowu #Yaba #TrafficUpdate \n\n Traffic flow from Adekunle intersection connecting to the Third Mainland Bridge, both inward and outward, is currently free. However, Makoko junction and Panti are experiencing significant congestion due to traffic intersection alterations. Approaching Sabo is also marked by heavy traffic resulting from the same traffic intersection issues. \n\nThe stretch from St. Agnes towards Unilag junction, Yaba Tech, and WAEC is moving slowly due to ongoing road construction. Jibowu underneath the bridge is clear in both inward and outward directions. Heading from Jibowu towards Fadeyi is a steady flow of traffic. Traffic moving from Jibowu inward Yaba Phase 1 and 2 is very smooth. \n\nThe entirety of Muritala Muhammed Way down to Adekunle is experiencing steady movement. Oyingbo inwards Iddo is clear, as is the alternate route via Ile Ile, with the return journey also reporting good flow. Kano Street inwards from Apena Cemetery down to Adekunle intersection is moving steadily. \n\nNo traffic impediments beyond the mentioned traffic intersection alterations and construction have been reported, and officers are present to manage the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
