      "text": "[5:52PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nThere is a gradual increase in congestion on the inbound route from the Airport turning through the National Stadium and Ikeja areas. While traffic is building, the situation is currently under control with our personnel actively working to mitigate any potential disruptions.\n\n The PWD, Shogunle, Ladipo, and Bolade junctions are currently experiencing smooth traffic flow. However, the approach to Bolade intersection is moderately busy. \n\nFor outbound traffic, conditions are currently good with no significant delays or incidents reported. Personnel are on-site to ensure the continued smooth flow of traffic. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
