      "text": "[5:58PM] #CBD_Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\n Significant improvement is observed around the construction site on Adeniji Adele road, specifically near the Oba's Palace and Police post. However, inbound traffic moving from underneath the Idumota bridge towards Eyin Eyo, connecting Balogun and Martin streets, is currently experiencing slow movement due to ongoing market activities in the vicinity. \n\nSimilarly, Tinubu Square, leading to Nnamdi Azikiwe street and towards the Tom Jones intersection, is experiencing heavy traffic due to the evening commute. In contrast, the Illubinrin route connecting Carter Bridge to Ijora and Oyingbo is currently flowing well. Overall, traffic impediments in the zone are reported to be minimal at this time, and officers remain on duty to ensure smooth traffic flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
