    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1935025952184033348",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1935025952184033348",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1935025952184033348",
      "text": "[6:19PM] #IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic congestion is on both sides of the highway, specifically from Araromi to Iyana Ipaja underneath the bridge, due to the high volume of vehicular movement and the unregulated activities of commercial buses. However, our personnel are actively engaged in checkmating and controlling the situation.\nTraffic is moving smoothly over the flyover bridge, particularly from Moshalasi Roundabout towards the Expressway and vice versa. LASTMA officers are strategically deployed to decongest the area and restore normalcy.\nOur team is working diligently to evacuate a truck that broke down earlier in the morning at Alagba Roundabout.\nTraffic movement is fluid on New Ipaja Road, both inward and outward, at Estate Gate and Baruwa.\nThe stretch leading to Egbeda Junction is experiencing smooth traffic flow.\n\nLASTMA personnel are working assiduously to control traffic movement and ensure a smooth traffic flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
