      "text": "[6:52PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nBroad Street from General Hospital to Tinubu Square, connecting Abibu Oki Street by Martins Junction is good.\nInner Marina Road from UBA Roundabout to NNPC Filling Station, inward Cathedral Church, down to Nitel Intersection is also good.\nState House to Force Road is smooth.\nZone 2 underneath bridge to Flagstaff House, connecting McWen Bridge, inward Bony Camp is better.\nOnikan Roundabout to TBS, onward Water Board, connecting Nitel Intersection is good.\nThe entire stretch of Igbosere Road is good.\nCatholic Mission Street connecting to Ganiu Smith Street is smooth movement.\n\nSlow and steady movement approaching Davies Street, inward journey to Apongbon.\n\nOur Officers are actively managing traffic, ensuring a smooth commute despite the evening traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
